顧問服務機構與其顧問服務人員之認可及管理規則」，並經勞動部認可之提供事業單位職業安全衛生相關技術性或專業性服務之法人或團體。 \n<> \n檔案下載\n<> \n1120703公告_訂定護理人員法第十二條所定其他經中央主管機關認可之機構.pdf \n<> \n<> \n閱覽人次 : 129\n<> \n0 \n<> \n<> \n<> \n<> 收合 \n最新消息 Latest News \n最新公告 Recent Announcements \n<> \n活動資訊 Event Info \n<> \n線上報名 Register \n<> \n問卷調查 Questionnaires \n<> \n<> \n護產執業 Nurse-Midwives \n執業環境改善 Improving the Working Environment of Certified Nurse-Midwives \n<> \n醫院護理職場資訊 Hospital Nursing Workplace Information \n<> \n護理職場爭議通報平台 Nurse-Midwife Workplace Dispute Report Platform \n<> \n護理人力規劃 Nursing Workforce Planning \n<> \n護理進階制度 Nurse Advancement System \n<> \n住院整合照護服務 Inpatient Integrated Care Services \n<> \n<> \n護產機構 Nurse-Midwifery Institutions \n護理機構評鑑結果 Results of Nursing Institutions Accreditation \n<> \n一般護理之家評鑑專區 General Nursing Home Accreditation \n<> \n產後護理之家評鑑專區 Postpartum Nursing Institutions Accreditation \n<> \n居家護理所評鑑專區 Home Care Nursing Clinic Accreditation \n<> \n護理機構照護管理系統 Nursing Process-Centric Institution Care Management System \n<> \n護理機構緊急應變 Nursing Institutions Emergency Response \n<> \n助產所專區 Midwifery Institutions \n<> \n<> \n原鄉健康 Health Care in Indigenous Areas \n原鄉健康照謢十大行動 Top 10 Health Care Initiatives in Indigenous Areas \n<> \n原鄉研討會 Seminar on Health Care in Indigenous Areas \n<> \n原鄉就醫交通補助 Transportation Subsidies in Indigenous Areas \n<> \n部落健康營造 Health and Well Being in Indigenous Communities \n<> \n強化基礎醫療照護設施 Strengthening Primary Health Care Facilities \n<> \n開業醫療機構獎勵及輔導業務 Incentives and Counseling for Medical Institutions \n<> \n空轉後送遠距會診平臺 Aeromedical Transport and Teleconsultation Platform (ATTP) \n<> \n<> \n離島健康 Health Care in Offshore Areas \n離島醫療照謢十大行動 Top 10 Health Care Initiatives in Offshore Areas \n<> \n離島研討會 Offshore Areas Seminar \n<> \n社區健康營造 Community Health Building \n<> \n轉診來臺就醫交通補助 Transportation Subsidy for EAMT to Taiwan \n<> \n開業醫療機構獎勵及輔導業務 Incentives and Counseling for Medical Institutions \n<> \n離島地區醫院醫療營運維持業務 Offshore Areas Hospital Operation Maintenance \n<> \n空中轉診後送 Em